WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:03.080
The Wuzhao warhorses' speed

00:03.160 --> 00:04.560
Far exceeds ours

00:04.640 --> 00:06.280
Absolutely do not engage in prolonged combat

00:06.360 --> 00:07.760
Yes

00:16.360 --> 00:17.280
Mount up

00:17.360 --> 00:18.760
Gag yourselves

00:21.760 --> 00:23.427
You must come back alive

